  {
    "text": "beingcoming more and more kind of",
    "start": 2052.079,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "suspicious about that",
    "start": 2054.48,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "and sometimes it feels like well it's",
    "start": 2057.919,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "almost like a moral obligation",
    "start": 2059.52,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "but we want to look is it actually",
    "start": 2063.04,
    "duration": 7.119
  },
  {
    "text": "wholesome suffering that's the question",
    "start": 2067.119,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "this path is about not squandering pain,",
    "start": 2070.159,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "but we want to be sensitive. Is this a",
    "start": 2073.76,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "wholesome form of suffering or is this",
    "start": 2076.399,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "some kind of almost moralistic sense",
    "start": 2079.76,
    "duration": 9.8
  },
  {
    "text": "that I'm supposed to be suffering?",
    "start": 2083.599,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "And um and so we we want to investigate",
    "start": 2089.599,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "investigate.",
    "start": 2093.679,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "And I I feel like our um",
    "start": 2096.399,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, we're just being called into a",
    "start": 2100.88,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "more radical form of compassion",
    "start": 2104.0,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and equinimity.",
    "start": 2107.68,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "And it's like, okay, what is compassion?",
    "start": 2110.4,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Compassion is like",
    "start": 2113.28,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "we we have this sense that well, it's",
    "start": 2117.92,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "the medicine for suffering. And in some",
    "start": 2120.079,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "ways it is that it's you know it's love",
    "start": 2122.56,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "in the face of suffering. It's the",
    "start": 2124.72,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "medicine for suffering. But it's not",
    "start": 2127.359,
    "duration": 7.521
  },
  {
    "text": "medicine whose efficacy we assume.",
    "start": 2129.52,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "In other words, we we don't know. It's",
    "start": 2134.88,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "it's just love in the face of suffering.",
    "start": 2137.52,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not the intolerance of suffering",
    "start": 2140.4,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's not uh some kind of frenzied",
    "start": 2144.4,
    "duration": 7.4
  },
  {
    "text": "insistence that it works.",
    "start": 2147.119,
    "duration": 4.681
  },
  {
    "text": "It's just love",
    "start": 2152.0,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's a love that wishes to alleviate",
    "start": 2154.8,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "suffering.",
    "start": 2157.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But there's a certain way and I sort of",
    "start": 2160.48,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "have glimpses of it in moments when the",
    "start": 2162.96,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "it's almost like the compassion is run",
    "start": 2167.2,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "through with so much equinimity too.",
    "start": 2169.839,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "And that doesn't make the love less",
    "start": 2174.8,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "potent,",
    "start": 2177.04,
    "duration": 8.039
  },
  {
    "text": "but it it just becomes like very",
    "start": 2179.68,
    "duration": 5.399
  },
  {
    "text": "Yeah. vast and and some of the layers of",
    "start": 2185.52,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "clinging and control that creep into the",
    "start": 2190.079,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "compassion",
    "start": 2194.48,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "is distilled out, refined out.",
    "start": 2196.88,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "That feels very different",
    "start": 2200.72,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "because a lot of my compassion I feel",
    "start": 2203.52,
    "duration": 8.079
  },
  {
    "text": "like takes um",
    "start": 2208.56,
    "duration": 7.519
  },
  {
    "text": "is is is entangled with some measure of",
    "start": 2211.599,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "control",
    "start": 2216.079,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "some way in which I'm at some level",
    "start": 2218.079,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "refusing the first noble truth.",
    "start": 2221.52,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "If I really got duka,",
    "start": 2225.28,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe that's a question. If we really",
    "start": 2228.56,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "really got duka suffering,",
    "start": 2232.4,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "comprehend suffering, the Buddha says,",
    "start": 2236.96,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "if we got that deeply,",
    "start": 2239.28,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "what would that do to our compassion?",
    "start": 2242.24,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "I I don't know.",
    "start": 2246.24,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Said only our hearts understand duka",
    "start": 2248.48,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "fully.",
    "start": 2250.8,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But I get little in kind of intuitive",
    "start": 2256.24,
    "duration": 7.8
  },
  {
    "text": "hints on what that might be",
    "start": 2259.44,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "to really know suffering",
    "start": 2264.24,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2271.92,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "for that love to",
    "start": 2274.0,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "rise up",
    "start": 2277.44,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "to try to meet the suffering. uh that",
    "start": 2280.0,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "might be alleviated.",
    "start": 2282.88,
    "duration": 3.479
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2287.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "that entails a kind of um",
    "start": 2292.079,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "refining our relationship with",
    "start": 2296.96,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "helplessness,",
    "start": 2298.8,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "which I I've been talking about a lot. I",
    "start": 2301.04,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "feel like for I don't know a couple",
    "start": 2304.32,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "years few years maybe",
    "start": 2306.64,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "that that word helplessness which",
    "start": 2309.52,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "sometimes is a kind of acts as a synonym",
    "start": 2311.44,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "for uh for for duka for suffering",
    "start": 2314.4,
    "duration": 9.959
  },
  {
    "text": "and um",
    "start": 2320.8,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "can our heart",
    "start": 2326.72,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "remain open on the other side of our",
    "start": 2329.68,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "power",
    "start": 2332.48,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "or is love reserved for only times when",
    "start": 2334.0,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "it can be exercised?",
    "start": 2336.56,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Is love reserved only for times when we",
    "start": 2339.599,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "can make some move?",
    "start": 2342.64,
    "duration": 7.479
  },
  {
    "text": "What happens when we can make no move?",
    "start": 2345.2,
    "duration": 4.919
  },
  {
    "text": "I I want my heart to still",
    "start": 2353.359,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "be capable of",
    "start": 2356.88,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "something in those moments.",
    "start": 2359.44,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And it connects to",
    "start": 2370.4,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "sense of um of mortality for me which is",
    "start": 2374.64,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "like okay",
    "start": 2379.2,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "if I really understood Anicha",
    "start": 2384.16,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "really understood that",
    "start": 2387.68,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "what would my love look like?",
    "start": 2390.48,
    "duration": 8.76
  },
  {
    "text": "What would my rest look like?",
    "start": 2394.56,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And sometimes I've said you know that",
    "start": 2399.28,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "that famous refrain from Ajin Cha this",
    "start": 2401.28,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "cup you know which was not broken is",
    "start": 2404.079,
    "duration": 8.681
  },
  {
    "text": "already broken right and uh",
    "start": 2406.96,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and then goes on to say you know when",
    "start": 2412.88,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and when it does break",
    "start": 2415.599,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "I my heart won't break with it because I",
    "start": 2419.28,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "know it's already broken. very beautiful",
    "start": 2421.44,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "poetic way of expressing the depth of",
    "start": 2424.16,
    "duration": 7.64
  },
  {
    "text": "realization around a niche",
    "start": 2427.44,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "and we trace that out and we might say",
    "start": 2432.8,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm already dead",
    "start": 2435.119,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "sounds like some kind of like macob",
    "start": 2437.44,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "heavy metal refrain or something but",
    "start": 2439.68,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "okay",
    "start": 2443.44,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah",
    "start": 2446.079,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "what does that do to our love",
    "start": 2448.48,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "what does that you",
    "start": 2451.839,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "gets a little",
    "start": 2456.88,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "sober but also wild.",
    "start": 2459.28,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, nothing left to lose.",
    "start": 2462.16,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And my love still feels constrained by",
    "start": 2466.64,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "fear different ways,",
    "start": 2470.0,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "but I'm keeping a kind of",
    "start": 2472.72,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "relationship with that fear and this",
    "start": 2475.68,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "distorting effects. Not that we want to",
    "start": 2477.76,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "dismiss all fear or something like that,",
    "start": 2481.28,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "but um",
    "start": 2485.119,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "sort of like",
    "start": 2487.92,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "my whole life I've been just kind of",
    "start": 2490.16,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "like trying to listen,",
    "start": 2492.16,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "feel out",
    "start": 2495.76,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "a path and I'm listening and feeling out",
    "start": 2497.68,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "like when",
    "start": 2501.599,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "you know",
    "start": 2504.319,
    "duration": 4.161
  },
  {
    "text": "when it's time for the love to get more",
    "start": 2506.16,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "radical. le",
    "start": 2508.48,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "and um",
    "start": 2510.8,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "feel like I've been saying that for a",
    "start": 2514.24,
    "duration": 3.52
  },
  {
    "text": "while.",
    "start": 2516.0,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe it's just cowardice",
    "start": 2517.76,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "keeping me uh in place. Don't know.",
    "start": 2520.96,
    "duration": 9.879
  },
  {
    "text": "But there's something brewing.",
    "start": 2526.88,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "Something brewing.",
    "start": 2531.28,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "It's kind of like mismatch between the",
    "start": 2559.839,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "architecture of our nervous just um",
    "start": 2562.48,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "in this world.",
    "start": 2566.24,
    "duration": 5.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Now",
    "start": 2569.119,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "just",
    "start": 2573.04,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "my nervous system doesn't feel like uh",
    "start": 2576.319,
    "duration": 6.04
  },
  {
    "text": "tolerant of loving in the way I wish to",
    "start": 2582.88,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "love you know",
    "start": 2585.68,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh caring about what",
    "start": 2589.599,
    "duration": 8.041
  },
  {
    "text": "warrants our There.",
    "start": 2593.76,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "We don't have to have answers.",
    "start": 2607.599,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "Just uh have good questions",
    "start": 2611.76,
    "duration": 5.319
  },
  {
    "text": "uh for this uh for your consideration.",
    "start": 2618.16,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, thank you. Uh, thank you all.",
    "start": 2623.92,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "Yeah, appreciate",
    "start": 2630.56,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "uh",
    "start": 2634.64,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "all all that's in the chat. I'll take a",
    "start": 2639.119,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "look at that and uh maybe get inspired.",
    "start": 2641.28,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "I will actually prepare something next",
    "start": 2643.68,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "time.",
    "start": 2647.68,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2649.2,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, I wish you wish you all well. I'm",
